    - target: {fileID: 6428940651312042302, guid: 0a43f4c68797e3549bfeae42b9993b40, type: 3}
      propertyPath: SceneToLoad
      value: WinScreen
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6428940651312042302, guid: 0a43f4c68797e3549bfeae42b9993b40, type: 3}
      propertyPath: eventSystem
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 1914264053}
    - target: {fileID: 6428940651312042302, guid: 0a43f4c68797e3549bfeae42b9993b40, type: 3}
      propertyPath: missionTexts.Array.size
      value: 5
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6428940651312042302, guid: 0a43f4c68797e3549bfeae42b9993b40, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'missionTexts.Array.data[0]'
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6428940651312042302, guid: 0a43f4c68797e3549bfeae42b9993b40, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'missionTexts.Array.data[1]'
      value: Second job is on 12 Victory Street.  Clients had to flee the place.
        Too scared to go back themselves. They just want their things out.  Emotionally
        valuable stuff, so be careful with it. I'll send the list. Don't hang around
        in there  longer than you need to. This one feels different.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6428940651312042302, guid: 0a43f4c68797e3549bfeae42b9993b40, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'missionTexts.Array.data[2]'
      value: Because the rules and context of the job have  already been established
        in the House 1 call, this call does not repeat them. Its sole purpose is 
        to raise the stakes and deepen unease before players enter the second house.
        The tone is  noticeably more strained than the first call the dispatcher,
        who projected control and  indifference in House 1, now sounds uncertain.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6428940651312042302, guid: 0a43f4c68797e3549bfeae42b9993b40, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'missionTexts.Array.data[3]'
      value: ' The shift in the dispatcher''s composure is  significant: if the person
        sending players into these jobs sounds unsettled, it signals that House 
        2 is beyond even their usual frame of reference. The mention of emotionally
        valuable items also  quietly reintroduces the damage stakes without restating
        the rules explicitly,'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6428940651312042302, guid: 0a43f4c68797e3549bfeae42b9993b40, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'missionTexts.Array.data[4]'
      value: ' and adds a layer of  moral weight; these aren''t just objects, they''re
        what the family chose to risk going back for. '
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6428940651312042302, guid: 0a43f4c68797e3549bfeae42b9993b40, type: 3}
      propertyPath: objectsDelivered.Array.size
      value: 7
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6428940651312042302, guid: 0a43f4c68797e3549bfeae42b9993b40, type: 3}
      propertyPath: objectsToDeliver.Array.size
      value: 6
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6428940651312042302, guid: 0a43f4c68797e3549bfeae42b9993b40, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'objectsDelivered.Array.data[5]'
      value: 0
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
